{
  "captionsItemId": "64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b1",
  "cards": [
    {
      "end": 2370000,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:051ff965-7d3e-4856-90dc-2649da338cc6f4e1ccb4-2cd5-4711-b533-f39496c8a879",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 250000,
      "style": {},
      "text": "为什么你的 AI 没有别人的好用呢？",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 3513333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:573b7d8e-1d2b-42b1-95ed-989ea18b7bc6855fea68-5cd8-49c7-8e4b-2ba7d1af4e37",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 2633333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "同样的模型，",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 5793333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:573b7d8e-1d2b-42b1-95ed-989ea18b7bc66c878453-dac7-40b2-911f-45820c157d69",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 3513333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "差距全在这些不起眼的设置里面。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 7433333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:c2d32436-085f-4903-a44a-188506f6f20728a41769-e2d7-4695-9475-55b4a191e0c2",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 6033333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "GPT 官方承认",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 9306667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:097598d2-cfc4-4fa0-a2ba-255ac5976c4f10bae319-4c28-478a-a650-1d1fd42a59c2",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 7666667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "AI 太会拍马屁了。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 11086667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:38b18e66-dacd-4af3-b27b-f2884f39a93181d77e2e-0928-4e1d-aab0-4112d3c47252",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 9566667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "而他们给出了解决方案。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 13173333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:89411d90-0362-46cc-bb92-c20ba7db764fb935899f-ac50-4707-941d-c7ebf855f3ad",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 11333333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "都藏在你的设置按钮里面。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 16593333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:ca4cf439-792c-45f7-b221-acb469256d99fa385a70-f346-47e4-8890-e45ee9a03a63",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 13433333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "95% 的人从来都没有打开过这些设置按钮。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 17873333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:b97840b3-abcc-455d-adb2-f4bd14d25eab4a79af45-e174-4f1f-b39a-6daad927664a",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 16833333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "尤其是最后一个，",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 19273333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:b97840b3-abcc-455d-adb2-f4bd14d25eab3471de1f-063c-449d-8fd3-ffd9b0ecef94",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 17873333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "很多人用了几年都不知道。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 20773333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:aa62a4ef-9823-432b-b501-8519db577e860990e553-67e4-42e6-9fb3-110f65ea6543",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 19533333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "现在直接跟着我改。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 23393333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:5da34703-8d47-4e64-90d2-d851e29f6338c4cad65b-8ee4-44db-9003-e2ff99d2328d",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 21033333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "第一个，我们先改 GPT 的说话风格。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 24573333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:1a9be023-1c37-47bb-ac72-b567709d604a0b266667-f407-43d4-a41d-c128511ef688",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 23633333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "打开设置，",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 25793333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:1a9be023-1c37-47bb-ac72-b567709d604aa3aea49b-cb87-44ce-aa2b-15d4d4a53dbb",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 24673333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "找到个性化。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 27543333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:a1de8238-803a-4544-827c-1f85d502b19c8441dd77-96d1-465b-ab34-5232d3d36eb9",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 26033333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "如果你平时拿它工作，",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 28753333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:a1de8238-803a-4544-827c-1f85d502b19c36c69a44-238e-48f4-b9f6-4b073113f5ee",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 27593333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "我更建议你",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 30880000,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:84c1497c-f4bc-41af-af34-6f64f172f12427d11491-49cd-4526-9757-4fc70bf456f8",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 29000000,
      "style": {},
      "text": "选择偏专业、高效、",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 32613333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:81ba9137-e81a-487f-bf8e-89f1ad90d08e8724f0d8-3342-49da-b176-17ba0afc38ed",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 31133333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "直截了当的风格。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 33466667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:34f8dd4d-08c6-47ff-b5f9-d24cc90d0bec99aa6e26-21ea-493d-ba7b-b3640638c8dd",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 32866667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "为什么？",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 35373333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:fb1e30e2-dd41-47d2-aab1-2df6efe36b835d5d42c9-545f-47b2-834b-aa487e2d5c80",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 33733333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "因为很多人最烦的一点就是，",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 37253333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:fb1e30e2-dd41-47d2-aab1-2df6efe36b83927b3ade-b320-458d-b1b0-3c7c7c25a261",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 35373333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "你说什么它都先夸你两句。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 38980000,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:f9877bed-892d-4b88-b103-1498a194c20368284366-84ac-40da-b1e6-b32668f14554",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 37500000,
      "style": {},
      "text": "例如，你的想法很棒。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 40593333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:a9c75bd0-992c-4a6d-a986-c6909a339485ef683602-2117-4abd-8c6b-0bb0331ba754",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 39233333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "这个方向非常有潜力。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 41633333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:5ad41aec-0623-440b-871a-4aa0f402bcb26d0e536e-4b7a-4a72-ac55-8b556903fd3a",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 40833333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "听着很舒服，",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 43793333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:5ad41aec-0623-440b-871a-4aa0f402bcb20763dd3b-69c7-4d05-ad2d-7259cee5c293",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 41633333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "但是对你解决问题没有任何帮助。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 46153333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:81de7398-d2ef-4017-8a76-e3dcb1148977355e8105-a244-4d57-838f-3bbfb8b66c09",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 44033333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "所以我自己给它的原则很简单，",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 48320000,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:6827b08d-aa7d-4af3-8848-94ee8591360b6ff7a79d-05ac-408f-a3cd-5772c8212de3",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 46400000,
      "style": {},
      "text": "少哄我，多找出问题。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 51006667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:cc4f0a7c-f0c9-4db4-8503-2aef62e88e018dc55703-91e9-4653-b205-af3f2c175507",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 48566667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "第二个，把自定义指令设置好。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 52466667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:c8d35953-3c75-4d3c-a80b-8eedb708492e94731e46-a8c6-4910-9f64-4551baf7beda",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 51266667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "这一步非常重要。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 54813333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:3bfd22f4-2fd8-4115-9289-3a785c08834fcc0b5406-39b3-49a5-82ca-ebd6c62c07d1",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 52733333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "不要每打开一个新会话就告诉它，",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 55906667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:dcb416ad-b542-4dac-808d-d50bc64ccfe0a753a6de-42a8-4465-80c1-fb459b0b8e94",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 55066667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "简洁一点。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 57093333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:998ce60c-f81b-4004-bdce-6adfb9d42f515df873cf-3b5b-4b0d-a88e-8c0c5a8f9fdd",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 56133333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "不要说废话，",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 59166667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:686005b3-076e-46b8-ade5-0c7b00c0352457564220-947b-4076-aa57-30aa78b47c70",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 57366667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "如果我错了就直接指出来。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 62160000,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:a9c50908-1896-45ad-825c-2eb02df70712e788c73d-df1e-4d01-aafe-d507dabc149f",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 59400000,
      "style": {},
      "text": "这些要求一次性写进指令里面。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 63670000,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:327ecdad-481a-41f0-a603-53e6897665154c99a129-add9-4d97-9ab8-5d31621cf527",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 62400000,
      "style": {},
      "text": "比如我会告诉它。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 65813333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:3295e8e8-f15f-4d76-a42a-1518100336644d221189-5e6e-4271-baa1-e194f21c012b",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 63933333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "不要为了认同我而认同我。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 67266667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:cd4526cc-0347-47cc-8890-afe5574acb2df1afef60-05fc-4e0e-90b4-b043ea09751b",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 66066667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "发现我的逻辑有问题，",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 68106667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:cd4526cc-0347-47cc-8890-afe5574acb2d36086ee3-4b71-4eb5-9e0c-39a335052675",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 67266667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "直接指出来。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 69726667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:6580d737-311c-4d8e-ab07-7bd5a7347ddb923caf44-4237-463b-8cf9-465cc82d37cb",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 68366667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "回答优先给我结论，",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 70846667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:6580d737-311c-4d8e-ab07-7bd5a7347ddb26f6047f-e524-4ac7-b7fd-94fff18e6081",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 69726667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "再给我解释原因。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 73346667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:c096b3c9-331e-49b9-987a-ebacc9ab2d9d4e7c343b-7242-4111-b3b7-a8470afc601a",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 71066667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "不要堆砌一堆正确但没用的废话。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 74820000,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:5f246210-b7eb-42bd-b40a-45649fc6c53012473697-589f-45ac-8897-e1255fd2a62c",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 73600000,
      "style": {},
      "text": "设置一次之后。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 76466667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:62ec7575-ba10-4be4-a590-a88f01f296998eb6bd5f-9bcc-4083-ace9-4ab84ea65e51",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 75066667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "以后大量的对话都不用",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 76826667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:1828e642-dfe1-48e5-b665-8beb1cad3be05f37b697-6498-4ec4-9204-6072b3b20c2c",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 76466667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "重复。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 80140000,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:b545e201-f78c-4f8e-909a-291e5a146da79e5a80dd-7ed0-40bb-ac4f-0bc6a05bad43",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 77100000,
      "style": {},
      "text": "第三个就是检查它到底记住了你什么。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 81720000,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:549f95b2-7871-465a-8a29-065f13bf62ff29d737af-2a29-4281-9ca3-6cf84c2283b7",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 80400000,
      "style": {},
      "text": "还是进入个性化，",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 83366667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:152453e4-e8bc-45e7-a4fa-61bf88a1b6adc6645781-d43b-4095-8d8d-5403f64ba997",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 81966667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "找到记忆相关的设置。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 85480000,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:73f4b263-ba03-47d4-8981-816ff8c35aef9dc27845-4f8b-454f-8828-05375bff687b",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 83600000,
      "style": {},
      "text": "这里你一定要定期去看。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 87923333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:9334be09-230a-4adc-bc2e-55e5a2b34b0c262e5d3a-723a-415d-8bae-4246fec7527f",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 85733333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "因为你半年前随口说的一句话，",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 89093333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:9334be09-230a-4adc-bc2e-55e5a2b34b0c39f0d989-7277-407e-b306-f47592252f5d",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 87933333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "它可能就给你记住了。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 91126667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:d494ec2f-6da0-4198-a251-094983ff373047b35805-e97b-4c52-a602-abb20b1f50ee",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 89366667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "可能不是你现在的真实情况了。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 92586667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:a3df4ace-5b98-4cd3-abac-3a3785f0b0c171dc10ab-fde3-4010-9d1e-2beec7a62ec5",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 91366667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "比如你以前告诉它，",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 94153333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:13532394-e83b-4939-ba6b-2651b1d3f5b3a7dfd95e-6eba-4cc0-bfa7-70887ff76ad8",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 92833333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "我最近在减肥。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 95760000,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:de897c88-8be1-4ef9-b968-a9cb61cb5bcd89f3cb13-7a46-4d2a-8bef-45e191cb24d5",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 94400000,
      "style": {},
      "text": "后来你已经不减了。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 98808796,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:2e429e8d-f5b9-459d-a093-81c5459bba275bbb4ddd-5e30-4bff-8478-d99e042955b2",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 96008796,
      "style": {},
      "text": "但这个信息一直影响它后面的回答。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 101106667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:2ec162c8-9d20-4224-8208-9dd720eb2867ff95c1e9-df8f-4365-93bc-5fe7259970e0",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 99066667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "它给你的建议就可能会越来越偏。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 103133333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:6ce50e07-4434-47b2-ae23-ce2c047aa2c6d4c4acb2-984e-49e3-98fd-e701995e33b5",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 101333333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "所以它的记忆不是越多越好。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 105000000,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:5026c340-ebbd-4c7e-9ad7-d6a4724f8446f086d1bd-f326-4c7a-95c0-7713f12eeeb7",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 103400000,
      "style": {},
      "text": "准确的记忆才有价值。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 106073333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:b0dc8ec2-a2fe-43a5-949c-641d859f23e0ddfffa7f-1f03-4c18-8882-8cec0dd15a02",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 105233333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "最后一个。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 108093333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:072b0ca1-7b9e-4527-8137-9aaa5ac1f71ed643ccf6-334c-4842-9eb9-2b55ab37d442",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 106333333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "检查你的数据控制设置。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 109173333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:e9623dbd-f889-4918-9919-031be889f85946f264a9-9b5d-4119-b852-ad66e11d1dbe",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 108333333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "打开设置。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 112353333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:13a14d7c-031e-43da-ab3e-51b9d36e1cd228977cef-3413-4c53-a5c3-783d9fbfb6ed",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 109433333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "进入数据控制或者相关的隐私选项。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 113500000,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:7ddcbccb-b432-4e6d-ae1e-c3a148286714746e2cbb-f87b-425d-b779-1af3f1947585",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 112600000,
      "style": {},
      "text": "看看类似，",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 115316667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:a41b4911-05c0-4d8b-9f5f-19a3c58934c0c3741e7a-cbbe-486d-b966-dc81ca8dadb8",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 113766667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "帮助改进模型。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 117646667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:5c74577e-6860-4339-824c-5f513de371c23743ff4f-b4db-49cd-a462-e9518ca61584",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 115566667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "这一类选项是不是符合你的需求？",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 120260000,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:ce4afc1f-19e2-4e35-a9ad-60f7958444e475defbca-fc41-4048-a15f-367728a420f2",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 117900000,
      "style": {},
      "text": "尤其是你经常往 GPT 里面放。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 121260000,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:e7583036-a7f8-4133-9a11-b4f0521984635d916502-ba47-4149-9fe5-9739f01568f4",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 120500000,
      "style": {},
      "text": "公司资料、",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 121900000,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:e7583036-a7f8-4133-9a11-b4f0521984638d57b9fb-ba1f-4855-ad8b-0efb9e320c05",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 121260000,
      "style": {},
      "text": "客户信息、",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 122740000,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:e7583036-a7f8-4133-9a11-b4f052198463f437dcc5-519c-4118-9f50-51d2e9e8edb0",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 121940000,
      "style": {},
      "text": "商业方案。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 124520000,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:1cf4e4e6-25ca-45bf-8fb9-2fe0c01a422c5367a1a1-0668-4460-910d-753f2e1c3daf",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 123000000,
      "style": {},
      "text": "或者比较私人的内容。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 127206667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:e38a8280-7737-46ab-8314-04205f51cd5562b99723-1e16-402a-a134-19b7c6450865",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 124766667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "那你应该至少知道这些开关在哪里，",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 129193333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:77f1f605-a79c-4642-bf89-dcfbd8b05a70c3934a46-a028-487d-b613-1ef04b35a89d",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 127433333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "而不是一直用默认设置。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 131466667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:313ff686-8320-49be-9291-09e2fdc2fcb85efdfde9-3795-4b80-aadf-c80644c73e40",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 129466667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "这 4 个地方全部都检查完以后，",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 132106667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:313ff686-8320-49be-9291-09e2fdc2fcb85197dbf4-a807-474c-b369-98a1a8c8dd49",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 131466667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "你会发现。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 134493333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:01505f7b-2000-4f09-898e-896be986450f6a0fe0ff-c448-4faf-8791-a5436583105a",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 132333333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "真正让 ChatGPT 越来越好用的，",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 136486667,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:aa1c2593-8d2a-4224-ab15-b06c75ca4662bd5c0d75-a1fa-4260-8a29-f72514d7bf4d",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 134766667,
      "style": {},
      "text": "不只是换一个更强的模型。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 138333333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:9bccd514-e239-45d9-9e09-017d05ecef905e8ae0f2-8d08-46a1-b243-c0084a51891b",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 136733333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "而是让它越来越了解",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 140173333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:7cb80b6e-0b46-4e80-8a26-70454d0ed9f897125773-2347-4a73-aa40-2bbf79a04aa6",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 138333333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "你希望它怎么样和你工作。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 143280000,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:762d3c13-949c-415e-be8e-7caf8d62e9d0b77f7f5d-ea61-4149-b0aa-ae4806904d04",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 140400000,
      "style": {},
      "text": "如果你还在裸用 AI 先把这 4 个设置改了。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 146453333,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:9b261e5b-4e2f-4fbb-8388-765bd38ec9f516420b8a-034d-443e-b1d2-b8bd88978b2f",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 143533333,
      "style": {},
      "text": "关注我，接下来我还会继续把这些 AI 工具。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    },
    {
      "end": 148900000,
      "id": "36:64bd69ce-b744-47b3-bc65-15476404a2b136:f85ad191-ca93-469a-a079-e5139b129db4baf42fb6-2ec0-4e85-9323-10b133b424ec",
      "languageCode": null,
      "layout": {},
      "start": 146700000,
      "style": {},
      "text": "一个一个调成真正能干活的助手。",
      "trackId": "9a24c58c-8111-493e-b3d8-573fad333bf5"
    }
  ],
